{"id":"a295446296ee06c0","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md","title":"标准全归纳KF证明PA一致性","display":"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency — 标准全归纳KF证明PA一致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency"],"display":"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency — 标准全归纳KF证明PA一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-truth-induction]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency — 标准全归纳KF证明PA一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08a0ab6453addb52\" href=\"?note=08a0ab6453addb52\" title=\"91-df-truth-induction\">91-df-truth-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency-—-标准全归纳-KF-证明-PA-一致性\">thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency — 标准全归纳 KF 证明 PA 一致性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (带全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-归纳的标准 KF)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> (PA 的标准可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\)</span> (基础语言句编码谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 的真理化全局反思句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> (固定算术矛盾句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\equiv\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\equiv\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span> (PA 一致性)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}proves\\text{-}PA\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}proves\\text{-}PA\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的归纳对 PA 证明长度作归纳，KF 证明每条 PA 公理为真且推理\n规则保持真，从而得到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。组合真理公理又给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span>；固定矛盾确为算术句，故\nPA 不可能证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这不“突破”第二不完备定理：该定理禁止满足条件的 PA 证明自身一致，\n并不禁止严格更强、算术上非保守的 KF 证明 PA 一致。结论也依赖这里的\n全归纳版本，不能自动归给弱 KF 变体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency-—-标准全归纳-KF-证明-PA-一致性","text":"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency — 标准全归纳 KF 证明 PA 一致性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-induction","status":"resolved","id":"08a0ab6453addb52","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\equiv\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}proves\\text{-}PA\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":1928,"backlinks":[{"id":"5fc33cbab29395e4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e55a4d03b99a537e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d039c2f88345c0e7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-streng